						Name: "cpu",
						Target: hpa.MetricTarget{
							Type:               hpa.UtilizationMetricType,
							AverageUtilization: &valueCPUFixed,
						},
					},
				},
				{
					Type: hpa.ResourceMetricSourceType,
					Resource: &hpa.ResourceMetricSource{
						Name: "memory",
